        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">A culture that cares deeply, globally and together</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">From expanding access to care globally, to growing community partnerships, to multiplying our employees’ ability to give back, our employees are driven to give. Their involvement not only delivers value to the nonprofits we support but helps support employee engagement and retention. Through Stryker's employee giving and volunteering program, we are creating impact that is personal, powerful and lasting.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Interested in learning more about careers at Stryker?</span></span></p>\n",
